WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:12.000 line:2% position:50% align:center
线性方程组 / Linear equations
先假设共同分母非零。

2
00:00:12.100 --> 00:00:22.000 line:2% position:50% align:center
线性组合 / Linear combination
c = x a + y b

3
00:00:22.100 --> 00:00:30.000 line:2% position:50% align:center
仿射组合 / Affine combination
t a + (1 − t) b，0 ≤ t ≤ 1

4
00:00:30.100 --> 00:00:38.000 line:2% position:50% align:center
面积比 / Area ratio
同高三角形：面积比等于底边比

5
00:00:38.100 --> 00:00:50.000 line:2% position:50% align:center
标准基 / Standard basis
绿色面积比是 x；红色面积比是 y

6
00:00:50.100 --> 00:01:04.000 line:2% position:50% align:center
线性变换 / Linear transformation
非退化时，面积比保持不变

7
00:01:04.100 --> 00:01:14.000 line:2% position:50% align:center
有向面积 / Signed area
a₁b₂ − a₂b₁ = 2 S(OAB)

8
00:01:14.100 --> 00:01:22.000 line:2% position:50% align:center
行列式 · 外积 / Determinant · Wedge product
以标准有向单位面积计量

9
00:01:22.100 --> 00:01:30.000 line:2% position:50% align:center
有向体积 / Oriented volume
标准基张成的单位体积为 1

10
00:01:30.100 --> 00:01:38.000 line:2% position:50% align:center
逐列线性 / Multilinearity
列倍加不改变行列式 / Column addition

11
00:01:38.100 --> 00:01:50.000 line:2% position:50% align:center
标准基展开 / Basis expansion
此处 aᵢⱼ：第 i 个向量的第 j 个分量

12
00:01:50.100 --> 00:02:00.000 line:2% position:50% align:center
交错性 / Alternating property
交换两列，行列式变号

13
00:02:00.100 --> 00:02:08.000 line:2% position:50% align:center
置换 · 逆序数 / Permutation · Inversion count
偶数取正，奇数取负

14
00:02:08.100 --> 00:02:22.700 line:2% position:50% align:center
克拉默法则 / Cramer's rule
分母必须非零；保持外积顺序
